Presentations
=============

Conference and meetup slide decks powered by the JRebirth presentation module. Prefer the **ZIP** (bundled runtime via jlink): unzip, then run `bin/AppName.bat`.

Desktop applications are listed on the [Apps](../apps/index.html) page.

### All presentations

| Presentation | Event / format |
| --- | --- |
| [**JRebirth Tour**](../apps/JRebirthTour.html) | Guided framework tour for meetups and workshops |
| [**LightningTalk**](../apps/LightningTalk.html) | Short-format talk deck |
| [**Breizhcamp**](../apps/Breizhcamp.html) | Breizhcamp conference presentation |
| [**EclipseCON**](../apps/EclipseCON.html) | EclipseCON talk deck |
| [**EclipseDay**](../apps/EclipseDay.html) | EclipseDay presentation |
